  "title": "Tampa Electric selects Ericsson, OneLayer, and Burns & McDonnell to deploy, manage, and secure its private LTE network",
  "summary": "Tampa Electric has chosen Ericsson, OneLayer and Burns & McDonnell to deploy, manage and secure its private LTE Mission Critical Network. The collaboration delivers SIM lifecycle management, real-time device visibility and Zero Trust security for tens of thousands of connected utility devices, while providing a high-reliability platform that can evolve to 5G as grid and operational needs grow.",
